    "detailed_description": "Hero vs 1000 is an action game focused on combat against hordes of enemies. Face your opponents in different ways to show your skill and determination on the battlefield.<br><br>Embark on an epic journey through three distinct eras! Lead a medieval knight, a fearless Caribbean pirate, and a modern soldier against hordes of ruthless opponents. Take on the challenge of defeating 1000 enemies in each level and write your own tale of bravery!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons</h2>Buy weapons and unlock new ways to fight your opponents.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Achievements</h2>Show off your combat skills by eliminating enemies in different ways and earn achievements.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayability</h2>Face the enemies in each phase as many times as you want and in the combat style you prefer.",
    "about_the_game": "Hero vs 1000 is an action game focused on combat against hordes of enemies. Face your opponents in different ways to show your skill and determination on the battlefield.<br><br>Embark on an epic journey through three distinct eras! Lead a medieval knight, a fearless Caribbean pirate, and a modern soldier against hordes of ruthless opponents. Take on the challenge of defeating 1000 enemies in each level and write your own tale of bravery!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons</h2>Buy weapons and unlock new ways to fight your opponents.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Achievements</h2>Show off your combat skills by eliminating enemies in different ways and earn achievements.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayability</h2>Face the enemies in each phase as many times as you want and in the combat style you prefer.",
